{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 37,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of David. Fret not thyself because of evil doers, neither be thou envious against the workers of iniquity.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For they shall soon be cut down like the grass, and wither as the green herb.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Trust in the LORD, and do good; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " shalt thou dwell in the land, and verily thou shalt be fed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Delight thyself also in the LORD; and he will give thee the desires of thy heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Commit thy way to the LORD; trust also in him; and he will bring ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to pass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he will bring forth thy righteousness as the light, and thy judgment as the noon-day.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rest in the LORD, and wait patiently for him: fret not thyself because of him who prospereth in his way, because of the man who bringeth wicked devices to pass.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Cease from anger, and forsake wrath: fret not thyself in any wise to do evil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For evil doers shall be cut off: but those that wait upon the LORD, they shall inherit the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For yet a little while, and the wicked ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ": yes, thou shalt diligently consider his place, and it ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the meek shall inherit the earth; and shall delight themselves in the abundance of peace.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked plotteth against the just, and gnasheth upon him with his teeth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD will laugh at him: for he seeth that his day is coming.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked have drawn out the sword, and have bent their bow, to cast down the poor and needy, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to slay such as are of upright deportment.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Their sword shall enter into their own heart, and their bows shall be broken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A little that a righteous man hath ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " better than the riches of many wicked.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the arms of the wicked shall be broken: but the LORD upholdeth the righteous.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD knoweth the days of the upright: and their inheritance shall be for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They shall not be ashamed in the evil time: and in the days of famine they shall be satisfied.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the wicked shall perish, and the enemies of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as the fat of lambs: they shall consume; into smoke shall they consume away.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked borroweth, and payeth not again: but the righteous showeth mercy, and giveth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "such as are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " blessed by him shall inherit the earth; and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they that are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cursed by him shall be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The steps of a ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "good",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " man are ordered by the LORD: and he delighteth in his way.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Though he should fall, he shall not be utterly cast down: for the LORD upholdeth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him with",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " his hand.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have been young, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "now",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " am old; yet I have not seen the righteous forsaken, nor his seed begging bread.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ever merciful, and lendeth; and his seed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " blessed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Depart from evil, and do good; and dwell for evermore.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the LORD loveth judgment, and forsaketh not his saints; they are preserved for ever: but the seed of the wicked shall be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous shall inherit the land, and dwell therein for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The mouth of the righteous speaketh wisdom, and his tongue talketh of judgment.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The law of his God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in his heart; none of his steps shall slide.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The wicked watcheth the righteous, and seeketh to slay him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD will not leave him in his hand, nor condemn him when he is judged.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wait on the LORD, and keep his way, and he will exalt thee to inherit the land: when the wicked are cut off, thou shalt see ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I have seen the wicked in great power, and spreading himself like a green bay tree.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Yet he passed away, and lo, he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not: yes, I sought him, but he could not be found.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Mark the perfect ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "man",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and behold the upright: for the end of ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " peace.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the transgressors shall be destroyed together: the end of the wicked shall be cut off.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But the salvation of the righteous ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of the LORD: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "he is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their strength in the time of trouble.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.37.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.37.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD will help them, and deliver them: he will deliver them from the wicked, and save them, because they trust in him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
